# users manage-alice -------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: Manage User for alice on debian13: in sudo by group, a$
# password asked.$
$
# Manage User ##################################################$
$
  Managing: [alice]$
$
# User Configuration -------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Sudo                 Enabled$
   -  Granted by           group sudo$
  [ ] SSH Keys             None$
   -  Password             Set$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Remove admin rights  Take sudo away$
   2) Don't ask password   For sudo$
   3) SSH Keys             Add or remove SSH keys$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-3 or q]:$
$
$

